{{Culture of Balisca}}
The '''Spartakaid''' ({{lang-bl|Espartaquiada}}), alternatively the '''Confederal Spartakaid''' ({{Lang-bl|Espartaquiada Confederales}}) is a {{W|multi-sport event}} held every four years. It represents the highest level of national competition for Baliscan athletes. All [[Regions of Balisca|44 regions]] and the [[Indigenous nations in Balisca|indigenous nations]] send teams to the games.

The last Spartakaid took place in 2021, hosted by the region of [[Cadaqués]] ([[Cerdanya]]). It was the first occurrence of the Spartakaid since the beginning of heightened public health measures were implemented in response to the {{W|COVID-19 pandemic}}. The next Spartakaid will be held in [[2024 Baliscan Spartakaid|2025]], taking place in [[Carpinchera]] region, within the [[Bayara|Bayaran]] [[Communities of Balisca|community]].

